<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Welcome to VenTrack - Vendor Invitation</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background-color: #90323d; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; }
        .button { display: inline-block; background-color: #5e0b15; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; margin: 10px 0; }
        .footer { background-color: #ba8a5c; color: white; padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }
        .credentials { background-color: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffeaa7; padding: 15px; margin: 15px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Welcome to VenTrack</h1>
            <p>Vendor Compliance Tracking System</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h2>Hello {{vendorName}},</h2>

            <p>You have been invited to join <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> as a vendor in our compliance tracking system.</p>

            <p>Your account has been created and you can now access the VenTrack platform to manage your compliance documents and track requirements.</p>

            <div class="credentials">
                <h3>Your Temporary Login Credentials:</h3>
                <p><strong>Email:</strong> {{vendorName}}'s email address</p>
                <p><strong>Temporary Password:</strong> {{tempPassword}}</p>
                <p style="color: #d9534f; font-weight: bold;">⚠️ Please change your password after first login for security.</p>
            </div>

            <p>To get started, please click the button below to accept your invitation and set up your account:</p>

            <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" class="button">Accept Invitation & Set Password</a>

            <p><strong>Invitation expires:</strong> {{expiresAt}}</p>

            <p>If the button doesn't work, you can copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
            <p style="word-break: break-all; background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px;">{{inviteUrl}}</p>

            <p>If you have any questions, please contact your administrator:</p>
            <p><strong>{{inviterName}}</strong><br>
            Email: {{inviterEmail}}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>This email was sent by VenTrack - Vendor Compliance Tracking System</p>
            <p>If you did not expect this invitation, please ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>